# uv artifacts. marketdata installs with `uv pip install -e .`, the pip-compatible
# interface, so uv.lock is never read here: a stray one is left by anyone running
# `uv lock` or `uv sync` in the checkout. The dependency record is requirements.lock.
uv.lock
